          "text": "In an interview with Channel 13 of Rio de Janeiro television on the night of August 27, 1957, \"Prof. João de Freitas Guimarães, a professor and full-time professor at the Catholic Faculty of Law in Santos, SP,\" described his strange encounter with a flying saucer and its crew. Interviewed by SBEDW, he confirmed his statements, which are as follows:\n\n\"On June 16, while practicing law, I encountered a SPOR AG. 2.\"",
